Kind: ablation
Issue: #923
Takes out: the extra tick -- convert_ipc_timeout_to_ticks() counts a timeout from the next interrupt again, so a 10 ms sleep at 100 Hz ends at the next tick, often well before 10 ms: musl_test's [25] must count short sleeps among its 50
Run: --entry 14 600 -smp 4
Expect: musl_test: \[25\] WRONG -- .* [1-9][0-9]* of 50 10 ms sleeps short

diff --git a/uros/src/mach_kernel/kern/ipc_sched.h b/uros/src/mach_kernel/kern/ipc_sched.h
index f8b45b5d..30167550 100644
--- a/uros/src/mach_kernel/kern/ipc_sched.h
+++ b/uros/src/mach_kernel/kern/ipc_sched.h
@@ -125,7 +125,7 @@ convert_ipc_timeout_to_ticks(mach_msg_timeout_t millis)
 {
 	if (millis == 0)
 		return 0;
-	return millis / 1000 * hz + (millis % 1000 * hz + 999) / 1000 + 1;
+	return millis / 1000 * hz + (millis % 1000 * hz + 999) / 1000;	/* 923-no-extra-tick */
 }
 
 
